OL,3,GNEWSASusie Dent says learning 'special'
OL,4,AWelsh language is on her bucket list
OL,5,
OL,6,FSusie Dent has been a familiar face on
OL,7,Ftelevision for more than 30 years,
OL,8,Fsitting in the "dictionary corner" on
OL,9,FChannel 4's Countdown since 1992.
OL,11,FThe lexicographer speaks four languages
OL,12,Ffluently - English, German, French and
OL,13,FSpanish, as well as Finnish to a good
OL,14,Fstandard.
OL,16,FBut speaking to Lucy Owen on BBC Radio
OL,17,FWales, Dent said she also wanted to
OL,18,Flearn Welsh.
OL,20,F"I've said for a long time that it's on
OL,21,Fmy bucket list to learn Welsh," said
OL,22,FDent, who was born in Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
